TEXT -184 536 Left 2 !.model SW SW(Ron=1m Roff=1Meg Vt=0.6 Vh=0.2)
TEXT 1536 -80 Left 2 !; --- Circuit Parameters ---\n.param Vdc = 100\n.param freq = 50\n.param alpha_deg=30.0\n.param Vgate = 5\n \n; Force floating-point division using 360.0\n.param T = 1/freq\n.param t_alpha = (alpha_deg / 360.0) * T\n.param Ton = (T/2) - (2*t_alpha)\n \n; --- Simulation Command (Starts saving at 0s, runs for 6 full cycles = 120ms) ---\n.tran 0 120m 0 100n\n \n; --- Fourier Analysis (Analyzes last 20ms cycle from 100ms to 120ms) ---\n.four 50 9 V(Vo+,Vo-)\n \n; --- Automated Measurements (.meas) ---\n.meas Vo_RMS RMS V(Vo+,Vo-) FROM 100m TO 120m\n.meas Vo_AVG AVG V(Vo+,Vo-) FROM 100m TO 120m\n.meas Vo_PEAK MAX V(Vo+,Vo-) FROM 100m TO 120m\n.meas Io_RMS RMS I(R1) FROM 100m TO 120m\n.meas P_AVG AVG V(Vo+,Vo-)*I(R1) FROM 100m TO 120m
TEXT 2544 24 Left 2 !.meas ALPHA PARAM  t_alpha\n.meas T_ON PARAM Ton
